        }
      ],
      "message": "wallet: return error from bitcoin-wallet create\n\nWhen MakeWallet fails in the create command, the error is printed but\nExecuteWalletToolFunc still returns true, so bitcoin-wallet exits with\nstatus 0. For example, running create twice for the same wallet prints\n\"Database already exists.\" and exits 0. Every other command returns\nfalse on failure.\n\nReturn false when the wallet can't be created, and test that creating\nan existing wallet fails.",
